QUERY PLAN
╭─ IRESEARCH_SCAN ───────────────────────────────╮
│ Index: jc_idx                                  │
│ Lookup: search                                 │
│ Projections: id                                │
│ Column Filter:                                 │
│ CAST(json_extract(doc, 'v') AS VARCHAR) = '42' │
│ ~2 rows                                        │
╰────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

query
SELECT id FROM jc_idx WHERE (doc->'v')::BLOB = '42'::BLOB ORDER BY id;
----
id
